      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>But that's the thing, it's not just a \"setback.\" It feels like the foundation is gone. Everything I built was based on this one thing, and without it, I'm just a shell. I look at the future and I don't see anything. No career, no purpose, just a bunch of years I wasted on something that ended up being nothing. It's like the version of me that mattered just died.",
